mmits/9b371d186d3970b20e947b65f10985d7f608273d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T13:12:00Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T13:12:00Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(12): dogfooding feature flags - portal gated by its own flags\n\nThe portal now consumes its own feature flags (product id \"backoffice\")\nvia the useBoFlags composable backed by @backoffice/sdk-js:\n\n- bo.feature gates the \"Feature Flags\" menu item in the Shell sidebar\n- bo.feature.create gates the Create Flag button (FlagsView) and the\n  Clone action (FlagTable)\n- bo.feature.update gates the Edit pencil action (FlagTable)\n\nportal/src/composables/useBoFlags.ts initializes the SDK client at boot\n(main.ts), exposes reactive evaluate refs, and is shared with remotes via\nModule Federation (vite.config.ts shell exposes + mui-feature-flags\nenv.d.ts typings). Fail-open defaults keep the UI usable if bootstrap\nfails or a flag is missing.\n\nBackend: flags router refactored with _check_scope_permission covering\nglobal/tenant/product/company scopes (TenantAdmin/TenantOwner now see\nproduct and company scoped flags); covered by new\ntest_feature_flags_router.py (46/46 backend tests pass).\n\nVerified: portal vitest 4/4 (useBoFlags), mui-feature-flags 6/6, both\nbuilds green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bef78db44939ee35e092c13b470422a9c637725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/1bef78db44939ee35e092c13b470422a9c637725"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/9b371d186d3970b20e947b65f10985d7f608273d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/9b371d186d3970b20e947b65f10985d7f608273d","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDliMzcxZDE4NmQzOTcwYjIwZTk0N2I2NWYxMDk4NWQ3ZjYwODI3M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829","sha":"eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829"}],"sha":"9b371d186d3970b20e947b65f10985d7f608273d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/9b371d186d3970b20e947b65f10985d7f608273d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:41:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:41:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: add phase 12 dogfooding feature flags to roadmap\n\nPortal gated by its own flags (product backoffice): bo.feature (menu),\nbo.feature.create (Create Flag + Clone), bo.feature.update (Edit pencil).\nCONTEXT.md captures the verbatim spec and open planning questions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c448dbbd8f4c1239d34a505c5c0b7a89d7f94adb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/c448dbbd8f4c1239d34a505c5c0b7a89d7f94adb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKGVkYTgxODU1MDdhYjFkNWFlZjg4N2VkNTFhZWU5N2Y1YjZiOGY4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62","sha":"036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62"}],"sha":"eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/eda8185507ab1d5aef887ed51aee97f5b6b8f829"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(design): add white-label configuration Stitch mockup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"206ab66496f112b04b89eb0a86e8c05a2039a1ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/206ab66496f112b04b89eb0a86e8c05a2039a1ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDAzNmZjMjJmMmRlNDM4ZGUyZjhmMTYwZGFmNmI5NjhiNTFmNDdkNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b","sha":"af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b"}],"sha":"036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/036fc22f2de438de2f8f160daf6b968b51f47d62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(tenants): persist product subscriptions when editing a tenant\n\nProduct selection in the tenant drawer never reached the backend:\n\n- The form sent products[] inside the tenant PATCH/POST body, but\n  TenantCreate/TenantUpdate dropped the field silently (subscriptions moved\n  to tenant_subscriptions in b003). The real API is the dedicated\n  POST/DELETE /tenants/{id}/products/{product_id} endpoints, which the UI\n  never called. The store now diffs current vs desired products and fires\n  subscribe/unsubscribe calls before the PATCH so the response carries the\n  fresh subscription set.\n\n- The drawer shallow-copied the tenant, so formData.products shared the\n  store tenant''s array reference — checkbox toggles mutated the store\n  baseline in place and the save diff always came out empty. Drawer and\n  form now copy the array on init/resync.\n\n- Drop legacy products: [''Core''] drawer default (nonexistent slug that\n  would 404 on create).\n\nVerified E2E: toggling core->analytics fires POST /tenants/1/products/analytics\nand DELETE /tenants/1/products/core before PATCH /tenants/1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f704437060839a4c57c2458c9752bbcb1febe64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/f704437060839a4c57c2458c9752bbcb1febe64e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKGFmNjA1NzMwZDczZjFiYjA2ODBjNGJlYWJmMDk1ZmIyNDMzNWQ1OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a","sha":"1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a"}],"sha":"af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/af605730d73f1bb0680c4beabf095fb24335d59b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:07:19Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:07:19Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(portal): add missing RemoteErrorBoundary component\n\nportal/src/router/index.ts imports and routes to this component (line 95)\nbut the file was never committed — any fresh clone failed to build. It only\nworked locally because the file existed untracked on disk.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a10e8041d9b632ed35f6ecaaaaca3e53967de114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/a10e8041d9b632ed35f6ecaaaaca3e53967de114"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDFkZWEwZTg3MmQ5OGJhMWEzMTNmNDg2ODZmY2E0NjY4ODEyMzQzOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155","sha":"8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155"}],"sha":"1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1dea0e872d98ba1a313f48686fca46688123439a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:07:18Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:07:18Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore: untrack compiled __pycache__ artifacts\n\n.gitignore already excludes __pycache__/ and *.pyc, but the files were\ncommitted before the rule existed so git kept tracking them. Removed from\nthe index only — files remain on disk for the running backend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f70b6540fb732f6b3254634c9833759980da83db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/f70b6540fb732f6b3254634c9833759980da83db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDg2MzBjZWUwOTNhY2JjMjhjNWFhMTQwZDRlZDhhYmQ4ZTFmYjExNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab","sha":"5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab"}],"sha":"8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/8630cee093acbc28c5aa140d4ed8abd8e1fb1155"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(products): products catalog CRUD page in mui-tenants\n\nCompletes the Phase 9/10 goal \"Products UI lives in mui-tenants\" — only the\nservice and tenant subscription checkboxes had been delivered; the catalog\npage, /products route and nav entry were never built (nav was a disabled\nplaceholder).\n\n- ProductsView per design/stitch/products-management.html: 9+3 grid with\n  catalog table and Recent Changes sidebar derived from real updated_at\n- ProductTable: slug/name/description, status dot + label chips,\n  All/Active/Inactive filter, created/updated dates, row click to edit\n- ProductDrawer: create/edit with immutable slug (backend ^[a-z0-9_]{1,50}$\n  validation), status select, labels chip input\n- products service rewritten: create/update added and list response fixed —\n  backend returns a plain array but the service read data.items, so\n  listProducts() always returned [] (also broke TenantForm product access)\n- /products route registered in mui-tenants; Products nav button enabled in\n  the shell with active state (mock Author/associations columns from the\n  design omitted — no backend fields for them)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69efb47c6d580af7210552d8ecd980d8de7a5fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/69efb47c6d580af7210552d8ecd980d8de7a5fd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDViMDIwMTg2MWFkZjE1YThkYjM5ZmY5MTgzYWQ3YTc3MjFiZDU4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8","sha":"1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8"}],"sha":"5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/5b0201861adf15a8db39ff9183ad7a7721bd58ab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(flags): restore Stitch spacing in rule builder canvas\n\n- space-y-gutter never generated CSS: the \"gutter\" token only exists in the\n  Stitch mockup''s inline Tailwind config and was never ported. Use space-y-lg\n  (24px, same value) so Rollout / rule cards / Add New Logic Block keep the\n  designed separation.\n- AND connector: replace -my-2 with -mt-4 mb-sm so the line clears 8px from\n  the cards above and below (Stitch metrics), instead of overlapping the next\n  card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b27ce445827446c66c4e8e31689ae6df90fb3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/6b27ce445827446c66c4e8e31689ae6df90fb3f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDFkN2QxNjg4NWY4YmM4MWVlZTU4YTk4OWYwOGJjNWRjZmQyMGZjZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e","sha":"7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e"}],"sha":"1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/1d7d16885f8bc81eee58a989f08bc5dcfd20fce8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:03Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:04:03Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(tenants): break v-model echo loop that froze drawer forms in prod builds\n\nTenantForm/WhitelabelForm deep-watched props.modelValue and re-created formData\non every emit echo, feeding the deep formData watcher in an infinite cycle. Dev\nbuilds break it with \"Maximum recursive updates exceeded\"; prod builds freeze\nthe main thread on the first keystroke, making all drawer fields appear blocked.\n\nThe props watcher now skips when the parent hands back our own object reference\nand re-syncs only on a genuinely new payload (drawer open / tenant switch).\n\nAlso registers VITE_REMOTE_TENANTS in .env.playwright so E2E diagnostics can\nreach /tenants in playwright mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1994a172d101975b1cd21e571efc716627df53bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/1994a172d101975b1cd21e571efc716627df53bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDdhZGVlYWYxYzczYWJkNWViNjQyZjU3YWMwOWRjYTg2ZmVkODhiMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938","sha":"922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938"}],"sha":"7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/7adeeaf1c73abd5eb642f57ac09dca86fed88b2e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:03:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:03:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(bff): align products proxy rewrite with backend mount path\n\nThe proxy rewrote /products/* to /api/v1/products/* but the backend mounts\nproducts_router at /products (same convention as /tenants), so every catalog\nrequest returned 404.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b26a5b2640f3763717f0aa2e34a9de56cb17cd0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/b26a5b2640f3763717f0aa2e34a9de56cb17cd0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDkyMjA1M2E0MWRmNzgzZWFhOTM3ZDdjNjIyYzg5ODhjNjAzMmE5Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8","sha":"e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8"}],"sha":"922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/922053a41df783eaa937d7c622c8988c6032a938"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:50:05Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:50:05Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(tenants): real owner field and computed bento metrics instead of mocked data\n\n- backend: tenants.owner column (migration d001, applied), schema support;\n  stale tests referencing the dropped products column updated to cover owner\n- TenantTable: drop hardcoded mockOwners map, render tenant.owner with derived\n  initials (\"—\" when unset)\n- TenantForm/Drawer: Owner input in Identity section\n- TenantsView bento: \"+12% vs last month\" -> tenants created in last 30 days;\n  \"System Health 99.98%\" -> Active Rate computed from real status\n\nDB cleanup (QA MySQL): removed the 4 Stitch-mock tenants, 14 subscriptions and\n5 seed products inserted by the now-deleted seed_data.py debug script.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5dda0d0b67540917d737b28cdcbb073c1adf402","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/a5dda0d0b67540917d737b28cdcbb073c1adf402"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKGU1MGZiNjVjNDFmMjFjZmVkNTUwNzM2NGI1NjkzYWMwNDUxZTI1Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0","sha":"2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0"}],"sha":"e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/e50fb65c41f21cfed5507364b5693ac0451e25c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:49:54Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:49:54Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(portal): single Tailwind sheet for federated MUIs to fix responsive variant overrides\n\nEach remote shipped its own full Tailwind sheet via routes.ts, so a later-loaded\nremote''s base utility (e.g. .grid-cols-1) overrode an earlier remote''s responsive\nvariant (.md\\:grid-cols-3) — media queries add no specificity. The /tenants bento\ncards rendered stacked instead of 3 columns.\n\nPortal''s content globs now scan microuis/*/src so its single sheet covers all\nremotes; each remote imports tailwind.css only from main.ts (standalone dev).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5227225e0cd75bea1e99be58016044d70e002217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/5227225e0cd75bea1e99be58016044d70e002217"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDJlZDY5ZWU5ODM4MGMxNmUyMTBiMjRjNTk3NGYwYWFkYzNjNmUyYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/36c085ec5d0899144fc36c9eefa1421e12821887","sha":"36c085ec5d0899144fc36c9eefa1421e12821887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/36c085ec5d0899144fc36c9eefa1421e12821887"}],"sha":"2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/2ed69ee98380c16e210b24c5974f0aadc3c6e2a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/36c085ec5d0899144fc36c9eefa1421e12821887/commen