,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/f5eccbbe123fef385052540659645c63d44b6ce8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/53417ac37bf880714973252e2919bea01ad90ca5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:25:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:25:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(11-10): wire ws_reconnect_loop into FeatureFlagClient\n\n- ws_base_url derived from api_base_url (http->ws, https->wss),\n  overridable via constructor kwarg\n- initialize() spawns background asyncio.Task running\n  ws_reconnect_loop against {ws_base_url}/sdk/ws/flags/{tenant_id}\n- _handle_ws_message invalidates cache on flag_updated, no-ops on ping\n- close() cancels the WS task cleanly and is idempotent\n- __aenter__/__aexit__ support async with FeatureFlagClient(...)\n- export ws_reconnect_loop/compute_backoff_delay from package root\n- test_client.py: autouse fixture mocks ws_reconnect_loop so existing\n  tests don''t leak background WS-connect tasks","tree":{"sha":"0ffc5e0a23c921e30a4fcffa67c9a801d09b7b6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/0ffc5e0a23c921e30a4fcffa67c9a801d09b7b6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/53417ac37bf880714973252e2919bea01ad90ca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/53417ac37bf880714973252e2919bea01ad90ca5","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDUzNDE3YWMzN2JmODgwNzE0OTczMjUyZTI5MTliZWEwMWFkOTBjYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/2356e4e6778fdbccc389503c79895d34c0f54ea0","sha":"2356e4e6778fdbccc389503c79895d34c0f54ea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/2356e4e6778fdbccc389503c79895d34c0f54ea0"}],"sha":"53417ac