h first-message auth\n\n- compute_backoff_delay: min(30, 2^attempt) + jitter\n- ws_reconnect_loop: connects, sends sdk_key as first frame, dispatches\n  JSON messages to on_message, reconnects with exponential backoff,\n  resets attempt counter on successful connect, cleanly cancellable\n- 8 passing tests covering backoff bounds, auth, dispatch, reconnect\n  delays, and cancellation","tree":{"sha":"70888101ab26a4f34858d4c6ca7e1ee1e9c8487e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/70888101ab26a4f34858d4c6ca7e1ee1e9c8487e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/fc6392a172c5f7b3693558d518348b6b93c54676","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/fc6392a172c5f7b3693558d518348b6b93c54676","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKGZjNjM5MmExNzJjNWY3YjM2OTM1NThkNTE4MzQ4YjZiOTNjNTQ2NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/8f6a9c9837762a7502510f6db66f939c76e3f2cb","sha":"8f6a9c9837762a7502510f6db66f939c76e3f2cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/8f6a9c9837762a7502510f6db66f939c76e3f2cb"}],"sha":"fc6392a172c5f7b3693558d518348b6b93c54676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/fc6392a172c5f7b3693558d518348b6b93c54676"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/8f6a9c9837762a7502510f6db66f939c76e3f2cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:22:45Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:22:45Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(11-08): implement ReconnectingSocket with exponential backoff\n\n- First-message auth: sends raw sdkKey on onopen\n- Parses JSON messages, forwards to onMessage, ignores malformed JSON\n- Exponential backoff (1s base, 30s cap) + jitter on recon