/4 plans complete, all plan checkboxes checked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28ad04530fdb92758aea46ab3e65aaca0f64741a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/28ad04530fdb92758aea46ab3e65aaca0f64741a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/115ed525e2ff9499a653e0a048d3af1bd5c915b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/115ed525e2ff9499a653e0a048d3af1bd5c915b1","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDExNWVkNTI1ZTJmZjk0OTlhNjUzZTBhMDQ4ZDNhZjFiZDVjOTE1YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d","sha":"86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d"}],"sha":"115ed525e2ff9499a653e0a048d3af1bd5c915b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/115ed525e2ff9499a653e0a048d3af1bd5c915b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T00:02:42Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T00:02:42Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(portal): remove silentCheckSsoRedirectUri to fully suppress 3p-cookie iframe\n\nkeycloak-js 26 triggers the 3p-cookies/step1.html check when\nsilentCheckSsoRedirectUri is present regardless of checkLoginIframe.\nThe internal condition is: checkLoginIframe || silentCheckSsoRedirectUri.\nRemoving silentCheckSsoRedirectUri stops both iframe checks entirely.\n\ncheck-sso without silent redirect falls back to a brief redirect-based\nsession check, which works correctly across origins.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55183186a969cfebd7801219fcbccbc55bc7b4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/55183186a969cfebd7801219fcbccbc55bc7b4d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKDg2ZjQyNWQyNTlkNzkyNDZiY2IyNzM4YTUwODQ0OGMyYTliMGZkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4","sha":"f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4"}],"sha":"86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/86f425d259d79246bcb2738a508448c2a9b0fd4d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:59:49Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:59:49Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(portal): disable checkLoginIframe to avoid Keycloak CSP frame-ancestors block\n\nRemote Keycloak servers typically set frame-ancestors ''self'', which blocks\nkeycloak-js from loading login-status-iframe.html cross-origin. Disabling\nthis check also removes the 3p-cookies timeout in Chrome 80+.\n\nSilent check-sso via silentCheckSsoRedirectUri is unaffected — that iframe\nloads our own origin, not Keycloak''s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31b18c5b786c7c6a4ed3547c08177ea63f308038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/31b18c5b786c7c6a4ed3547c08177ea63f308038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/commits/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4","node_id":"C_kwDOSztszNoAKGY4NmUxZDEyNGNkYmEzNWI5YWVmNjAxN2Q0OTRkZjBlYzZmZTBkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/backoffice/commit/d27ee13d48791f88cc2d9386a2967a5a18e9ba70","sha":"d27ee13d48791f88cc2d9386a2967a5a18e9ba70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/d27ee13d48791f88cc2d9386a2967a5a18e9ba70"}],"sha":"f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/f86e1d124cdba35b9aef6017d494df0ec6fe0df4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/commits/d27ee13d48791f88cc2d9386a2967a5a18e9ba70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:55:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:55:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore(config): switch to QA Keycloak (oauth2.qa.comsatel.com.pe, realm Apps)\n\n- Update bff/.env.example and portal/.env.example to point to QA Keycloak\n- Rename portal client from backoffice-frontend to backoffice-portal\n- Add README.md with local dev setup instructions (no Docker required)\n- Add 01-03 SUMMARY.md (previously missing after stream timeout)\n\nKeycloak QA: clients backoffice-portal (public PKCE) + backoffice-bff (confidential),\n9 BackOffice realm roles, test user bo.admin/Backoffice1! with PlatformAdmin role.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19969dd77403da31347d9e0fe0e41ce5dd3753a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/backoffice/git/trees/19969dd77403da31347d9e0fe0e41ce5dd3753a1"},"url":