},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:42:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gateway): add WebSocket gateway URL config on login page (#560)\n\nAdds an \"Advanced Settings\" section on the login page for configuring\nthe WebSocket gateway URL, with 4 presets (ws/wss × localhost/127.0.0.1),\na custom URL option, and a \"Test Connection\" button that pings the\ngateway before saving.\n\n- Persisted via localStorage (STORAGE_GATEWAY_URL = ''mc-gateway-url'')\n- User''s explicit choice takes priority over NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL env\n- Dashboard reads localStorage on boot and sets full mode if present\n- 5s timeout on test connection","tree":{"sha":"554cf4cd9c1a0a1fb8682b425279061e39d1d4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/git/trees/554cf4cd9c1a0a1fb8682b425279061e39d1d4d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/git/commits/ceee57d8d500c71db1d9ff946f7f672ce6e2db6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 554cf4cd9c1a0a1fb8682b425279061e39d1d4d6\nparent 36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d\nauthor a452174234 <62130820+a452174234@users.noreply.github.com> 1775842948 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842948 +0700\n\nfeat(gateway): add WebSocket gateway URL config on login page (#560)\n\nAdds an \"Advanced Settings\" section on the login page for configuring\nthe WebSocket gateway URL, with 4 presets (ws/wss × localhost/127.0.0.1),\na custom URL option, and a \"Test Connection\" button that pings the\ngateway before saving.\n\n- Persisted via localStorage (STORAGE_GATEWAY_URL = ''mc-gateway-url'')\n- User''s explicit choice takes priority over NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL env\n- Dashboard reads localStorage on boot and sets full mode if present\n- 5s timeout on test connection","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TaECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz+YQAB1NhHElqN09Fhk7kyaeC7PB\npOQS2LY+RiWaz8xxMBd85zucJ7avEu1iEcYShohbnsxM8bl