ifyMcpCallReceipts(): integrity checks\n- GET /api/mcp-audit/verify: single-record or batch verification endpoint\n- Security scan integration: reports signed/unsigned ratio\n- Canonical JSON serialization (sorted keys) for deterministic hashing\n- Auto-generated keypair persisted in settings table\n- 147 lines of tests covering sign/verify/tamper/malformed inputs","tree":{"sha":"d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/git/trees/d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/git/commits/36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d","verification":{"payload":"tree d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe\nparent 2bb8bf6ed4afa44751029bd3da285d920776ba6b\nauthor TJF <tomjwxf@gmail.com> 1775842834 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842834 +0700\n\nfeat: add Ed25519 receipt signing to MCP audit pipeline (#556)\n\nCloses #555.\n\nImplements tamper-evident audit receipts for MCP tool calls:\n\n- src/lib/receipt-signing.ts: Ed25519 signing with Node crypto (no deps)\n- Migration 050: adds payload_hash, signature, public_key columns\n- logMcpCall(): signs each record at write time (~0.3ms overhead)\n- verifyMcpCallReceipt() + verifyMcpCallReceipts(): integrity checks\n- GET /api/mcp-audit/verify: single-record or batch verification endpoint\n- Security scan integration: reports signed/unsigned ratio\n- Canonical JSON serialization (sorted keys) for deterministic hashing\n- Auto-generated keypair persisted in settings table\n- 147 lines of tests covering sign/verify/tamper/malformed inputs","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TYSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdZQQACLwF1HNLAV2yxKwgAuQH92C\nHgsrk+ORuocJr4S9zVp7SDnDTc3VwCFm2oOgBkFPw1hUcMjKVPMtDZyK843w3bln\ncGA0GBAgpAXMFsW+1HGdaQFAEH5ChYr+sadajSljc8FhgB/huDhUjH0GgTDhMqiU\nNds0yVkmjh/cSN/dnI4HmhqoKpn8yOf//jYdYICtS/fVm7DovRCVGFuTUvQPTa4C\nZe5lyFEFNuGqfUcal