eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/commits/f12aac13c3fd8fc76d989463e6312adf534a82b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T14:52:12Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T14:52:12Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"feat: platform hardening — spawn history, auth warnings, security docs\n\nFR-D1: Add least-privilege auth guidance to SECURITY-HARDENING.md\n  - Agent-scoped keys vs global API key comparison\n  - Auth hierarchy table (scoped key > global key > session > proxy)\n  - CLI examples for creating scoped keys\n  - Monitoring guidance for global key usage\n\nFR-D2: Log security event when global admin API key is used\n  - Emits ''global_api_key_used'' event to audit trail\n  - Hints toward agent-scoped keys for least-privilege\n\nFR-D3: Add durable spawn history persistence\n  - New migration 043_spawn_history with indexed table\n  - spawn-history.ts with recordSpawnStart/Finish, getSpawnHistory,\n    getSpawnStats functions\n  - Replaces log-scraping fallback with DB-backed tracking\n\nFR-D4: Document rate-limit backend strategy\n  - Current in-memory Map approach documented\n  - Pluggable backend plan for multi-instance (Redis, SQLite WAL)\n  - Per-agent rate limiter details documented\n\nAlso fixes MCP test type annotation (content: string → any).","tree":{"sha":"90bfad83e120f4f5c30d9beea760cf13eb0558d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GroupHamlet/hamlet-mission-control/git/trees/90bfad83e120f4f5c30d9beea760cf13eb0558d3"},"url":"https://api.github.c