":"vyshakharikumar98@gmail.com","name":"VYSHAK HARIKUMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:29:56Z","email":"vyshakharikumar98@gmail.com","name":"VYSHAK HARIKUMAR"},"message":"refactor: enforce strict feature-based architecture across all apps\n\n- Split monolithic store/session.ts in customer, admin, and technician\n  into per-feature Zustand stores (constants, store, index barrel)\n- Customer: booking flow state moved to React Router navigation state;\n  DAYS/SLOTS/PACKAGES/TRACK_STEPS/ALL_REVIEWS_EXTENDED scoped to their\n  feature folders; AREAS inlined into LocationPicker; root data.ts deleted\n- Admin: unified useAdmin store split into useApprovals, useRequests,\n  useComplaints, useReviews; Shell updated to read from feature stores\n- Technician: useTechSession split into useOnboarding, useJobFeed,\n  useActiveJob with cross-store coordination via Zustand getState()\n- CUSTOMER_ADDRESSES promoted to @nammafix/lib (shared mock data used\n  by both booking and profile features)\n- All feature folders get index.ts barrel exports\n- Tests rewritten to import from individual feature stores; all three\n  apps pass tsc --noEmit with zero errors","tree":{"sha":"cce0a97620fac16d15792e294586fee73ecf50a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VYSHAK98/namma-fix-frontend/git/trees/cce0a97620fac16d15792e294586fee73ecf50a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VYSHAK98/namma-fix-frontend/git/commits/977bb463a4c2e297ce9aafeadd676c03a28b97ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68654778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VYSHAK98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VYSHAK98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VYSHAK98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VYSHAK98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VYSHAK