s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:33:03Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:33:03Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"message":"Backend: usable single-garment try-on, neutral provider errors, renderable mock output, consistent deletes, session cleanup, password reset email\n\n- SingleGarmentTryOn no longer demands exactly one body garment: the primary piece (dress >\n  top > outerwear > bottom) is sent to AI and the rest is reported as excluded, so the only\n  AI mode the Free plan allows works with the Builder''s always-dressed top and bottom\n- Provider/HTTP failures store a neutral user-facing job error; the technical detail goes back\n  to the worker log through TryOnProcessingResult\n- MockTryOnProvider emits a mock: URL that TryOnOutputStorage turns into an embedded,\n  labelled placeholder PNG stored like a real render (signed URL, retention) instead of a\n  path nothing serves; relative signed URLs are no longer misparsed as file: URIs on Linux\n  when deleting outputs\n- Deleting a garment detaches it from saved outfits and clears their generated preview in\n  every store; deleting an outfit removes its stored renders; ExpiredSessionCleanupWorker\n  finally calls AuthService.CleanupExpiredSessions hourly\n- Password reset by email: IEmailSender + PasswordResetEmail (Application), SmtpEmailSender /\n  DisabledEmailSender (Infrastructure, framework SmtpClient), Email__* configuration with\n  SMTP_*/EMAIL_* dotenv aliases, GET /api/auth/password-reset/availability, background\n  sending without an account-existence timing oracle, 503 outside Development when unconfigured\n- Premium role pins are configuration-only (Roles__PinnedPremiumEmails, no built-in default);\n  the owner admin pin stays built in","tree":{"sha":"040faca9fd1dbb5fee950af43a125977add6847f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/git/trees/040faca9fd1dbb5fee950af43a1