edc61358077ea15731e","node_id":"C_kwDOSzzyu9oAKGIwYWQ0NGFjNGM0NTkxMTM4NTcyZmVkYzYxMzU4MDc3ZWExNTczMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/commit/d3a225f09434b91ac3dba522b83b6380f9fdcef9","sha":"d3a225f09434b91ac3dba522b83b6380f9fdcef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/commits/d3a225f09434b91ac3dba522b83b6380f9fdcef9"}],"sha":"b0ad44ac4c4591138572fedc61358077ea15731e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/commits/b0ad44ac4c4591138572fedc61358077ea15731e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183058483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hortenh1x","id":183058483,"login":"Hortenh1x","node_id":"U_kgDOCulAMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/commits/d3a225f09434b91ac3dba522b83b6380f9fdcef9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:28:48Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:28:48Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"message":"Enforce the paywall: plan catalog, AI-credit ledger, tier gating, priority queue\n\nImplements stages 2-3 of PAYWALL_MODEL.md (billing/Stripe intentionally not\nwired - no credentials; roles switch manually via the admin panel):\n\n- PlanCatalog (role -> PlanLimits) as the single tier source; numeric caps and\n  allowances configurable via Paywall__Free__*/Paywall__Premium__*\n- account_credit_ledger (migration 012, all three stores): one-time free trial\n  grant (6), once-per-UTC-month rolling Premium allowance (100), debit on\n  try-on confirm before queueing, idempotent refunds for failed jobs, no spend\n  on cache hits or clothes-only previews, Admin bypasses the ledger\n- Tier gating in TryOnService.Estimate (RequiresUpgrade on plan-blocked modes)\n  so the confirm re-validation inherits it; Free repriced to 1k via\n  ITryOnProvider.CapabilitiesFor + TryOnGenerationSettings.Resolution (FASHN\n  reprices credits and settings hash, so tiers cache separately)\n- Free caps enforced in create paths: 50 garments / 20 outfits / 1 body photo\n  via EntitlementService.EnsureCanAdd*\n- Premium/Admin try-on jobs ride a priority queue (second Redis list, popped\n  first; two-channel in-memory queue)\n- GET /api/account/entitlements; POST /api/admin/users/{id}/credits with a\n  credits column + inline adjust in the admin panel; Builder credits chip,\n  Premium mode pills, upgrade notice, insufficient-balance confirm guard;\n  Wardrobe cap-usage notice\n- Backend console tests (7 new, 153 total) and vitest coverage (174 total);\n  README/CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/PAYWALL_MODEL.md synced","tree":{"sha":"176aa4efb18b9eb58205a664648b2813b9a7a8c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/git/trees/176aa4efb18b9eb58205a664648b2813b9a7a8c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/git/commits/d3a225f09434b91ac3dba522b83b6380f9fdcef9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183058483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/events{/privacy}","