026-06-09T20:01:12Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T20:01:12Z","email":"dmytro.bolibok@gmail.com","name":"Hortenh1x"},"message":"Что вошло:\n\nРасширены категории/зоны и slot compatibility rules для outfit composition.\nДобавлены private object storage контракты, local signed URLs, MinIO/S3-compatible adapter.\nUpload pipeline теперь проверяет magic bytes, декодирует изображение, auto-orient, strip metadata, resize/compress, thumbnail/private preview/cutout, perceptual hash.\nBody reference public /uploads/body-reference-photos/{fileName} теперь закрыт 404, выдача идет через signed /api/storage/signed/....\nДобавлены privacy endpoints: account export/delete, body photo delete, try-on output delete, purge AI outputs.\nTry-on jobs получили consent/provider/source/retention/deleted metadata.\nДобавлены auth hardening pieces: email verification/password reset token storage, rate limiting, session list/revoke-all, expired session cleanup.\nStartup schema init заменен на DbUp migrations из outfit_planner_back/database/migrations.\nОбновлены README.md, agents.md, backend tests и frontend types/client/category UI.","tree":{"sha":"0db97ddc372bc0b2ff5be802c442b5cbfd2b3276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/git/trees/0db97ddc372bc0b2ff5be802c442b5cbfd2b3276"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hortenh1x/outfit_planner/git/commits/d2307672509eeb9527f74953dd1b46895ea9459a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183058483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hortenh1x/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git