":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add Threadwick Studio redesign handoff (spec + product map) (#8)\n\nA complete design handoff for the Studio redesign — a unified, local-first\nshell that serves both artists (design) and makers (make), with the\nMarketplace as a decouplable peer. Captures every locked surface (Home;\nWorkbench patterns/projects; Library patterns/yarns/tools; the phone-first\nfollow view across all breakpoints; the Marketplace) plus the publish/version\nmodel and the deferred Creator Insights.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f261ed1ecad96d62697865cfc3999e492714f61e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/home/git/trees/f261ed1ecad96d62697865cfc3999e492714f61e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/home/git/commits/46175b5ed744748baa3e53c0e7264f7f2ce74dd3","verification":{"payload":"tree f261ed1ecad96d62697865cfc3999e492714f61e\nparent c9862fe5bd1167337d550735d12d2957cff6dc2c\nauthor Aurelio Solís <40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com> 1782172311 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782172311 +0200\n\ndocs: add Threadwick Studio redesign handoff (spec + product map) (#8)\n\nA complete design handoff for the Studio redesign — a unified, local-first\nshell that serves both artists (design) and makers (make), with the\nMarketplace as a decouplable peer. Captures every locked surface (Home;\nWorkbench patterns/projects; Library patterns/yarns/tools; the phone-first\nfollow view across all breakpoints; the Marketplace) plus the publish/version\nmodel and the deferred Creator Insights.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOcqXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKH0QACJId4h+gkQwfSso3Z/EWeOH\nbziy+lHwQ440XMZ5RooLIyjOMLC0E6iby+dZ9AJgsiDIlJOQZp8BumtEUu4FQJLG\nqrg5nA6Ruq+5ZLIY+TLPCj0gA5t3Rl1USIICF/CHchcnXKuiUUYFOfHRWTnCt5Hq\nZJv8jY+rslQ3aMPvvs07M4jZL3foUIRh9Pcdo21ScwOVPzHQIh/m