ame":"Aurelio Solís"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T16:04:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add roadmap bento + fairness \"Our promise\" theme\n\nAdds the \"What''s on the hook\" Apple-style bento roadmap (14 tiles incl. fingerprinting + API, audience-tagged Studio/For artists/For makers), an ink \"Our promise\" fairness band right after the hero, and threads a free-first fairness message through the hero, account band, FAQ, footer, and SEO/social. Reviewed: bento grid packs to exact rows, AA contrast throughout, copy consistent with the free-to-use / opt-in-selling model.","tree":{"sha":"2fc7e66d0b587a07ef64a47bf36bb3d076c52a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/home/git/trees/2fc7e66d0b587a07ef64a47bf36bb3d076c52a2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/home/git/commits/82f4a4c53e196e14d2d657328fb1f74a7df9a52a","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fc7e66d0b587a07ef64a47bf36bb3d076c52a2a\nparent 011ee6149c5b547997d4ff894640089c9852f558\nauthor Aurelio Solís <40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com> 1781107447 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781107447 +0200\n\nAdd roadmap bento + fairness \"Our promise\" theme\n\nAdds the \"What''s on the hook\" Apple-style bento roadmap (14 tiles incl. fingerprinting + API, audience-tagged Studio/For artists/For makers), an ink \"Our promise\" fairness band right after the hero, and threads a free-first fairness message through the hero, account band, FAQ, footer, and SEO/social. Reviewed: bento grid packs to exact rows, AA contrast throughout, copy consistent with the free-to-use / opt-in-selling model.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKYr3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5m8QACE2usVjVu3ykQ+qV230x84G\nE/dJLzFt4Ur2xQ+4JpkqZYIfeuLleXm6D8aKp4aEpbNOKOz2/p5QQ5tmTz/ZKIy0\nKJNwFKIDn/aOhBEMIzIUSIaF5jvxg2bLsU5gITczbVY68Q7/PvWn3HTbBfcCD+Q8\njT4kPmGdillhzk86uFaggVkKDa1MBnhSdtwi3J5puvaorCAJNqUg+YQI3FKHhKRd\nDSnVpso1pBMmlPz