ha":"d100dc01126d3f78c46fc04d66e20aa8b7cbfe14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pledgeandgrow/pledge-skills/commits/d100dc01126d3f78c46fc04d66e20aa8b7cbfe14"}],"sha":"f31f4b2e686237b01ffbd2bbb225d66c6576645d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pledgeandgrow/pledge-skills/commits/f31f4b2e686237b01ffbd2bbb225d66c6576645d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160181378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehdi-berel","id":160181378,"login":"mehdi-berel","node_id":"U_kgDOCYwsgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pledgeandgrow/pledge-skills/commits/d100dc01126d3f78c46fc04d66e20aa8b7cbfe14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:03:13Z","email":"pledgeandgrow@gmail.com","name":"nizar-ounich"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:03:13Z","email":"pledgeandgrow@gmail.com","name":"nizar-ounich"},"message":"Add comprehensive PHP 8.5 skill documentation (31 files)\n\n- SKILL.md: main entry point with quick reference, hello world, types, operators, control flow, functions, classes, enums, installation, project creation\n- basics-syntax.md: PHP tags, escaping HTML, instruction separation, comments, file inclusion\n- types.md: all types (null, bool, int, float, string, array, object, callable, iterable, mixed, void, never, resource), type declarations, type juggling\n- variables.md: scope, predefined variables, variable variables, external sources, destructuring\n- constants.md: define(), const, magic constants, predefined constants\n- operators.md: all operators with precedence table, strict vs loose comparison, null coalescing\n- control-structures.md: if/else, while, for, foreach, switch, match, declare, return, require/include, goto\n- functions.md: parameters, named arguments, variadic, arrow functions, first-class callable, anonymous functions\n- classes-objects.md: constructor promotion, property hooks, visibility, inheritance, abstract, interfaces, traits, anonymous classes, magic methods, final, cloning, late static binding, serialization, covariance/contravariance, lazy objects\n- namespaces.md: definition, sub-namespaces, importing/aliasing, global space, name resolution\n- enums.md: pure enums, backed enums, methods, static methods, constants, traits, interfaces, serialization\n- errors.md: error levels, error handling, custom handlers, error-to-exception conversion\n- exceptions.md: try/catch/finally, multiple catch types, throw as expression, extending, global handler, chaining\n- generators.md: yield, yield from, send, throw, return, practical examples, comparison with Iterator\n- fibers.md: suspend/resume/throw, lifecycle, comparison with generators, use cases\n- attributes.md: syntax, declaring, reading with Reflection, predefined attributes (Deprecated, Override, NoDiscard, SensitiveParameter)\n- references.md: assigning, passing, returning, foreach, reference counting, objects vs references\n- predefined.md: superglobals, predefined exceptions hierarchy, predefined interfaces (Traversable, Iterator, ArrayAccess, Countable, Stringable, Throwable, Closure, Generator, Fiber, WeakReference, WeakMap, stdClass)\n- security.md: session security, filesystem, database/SQL injection, XSS, CSRF, password hashing, error reporting, user data\n- features.md: HTTP auth, cookies, sessions, file uploads, remote files, CLI, garbage collection, I/O streams\n- stdlib-core.md: string functions, mbstring, array functions, sorting, function handling, output control, error handling\n- stdlib-date.md: DateTime, DateTimeImmutable, DateTimeZone, DateInterval, DatePeriod, calendar, HRTime, date error classes\n- stdlib-math.md: math functions, RoundingMode enum (8.4+), BCMath, GMP, statistics, trader\n- stdlib-crypto.md: hash, HMAC, password hashing, OpenSSL, Sodium/Libsodium\n- stdlib-xml-json.md: JSON, SimdJSON, cURL, DOM, SimpleXML, XMLReader, XMLWriter, XSL, XML-RPC\n- stdlib-database.md: PDO, MySQLi, PostgreSQL, SQLite3, MongoDB, OCI8, ODBC, DBA, SQLSRV\n- stdlib-spl-io.md: SPL interfaces, datastructures, iterators, exceptions, functions, reflection, fileinfo, filesystem, directories\n- stdlib-extended.md: Zip, Zlib, Bzip2, Phar, Rar, LZF, intl, iconv, mbstring, gettext, GD, ImageMagick, Exif\n- stdlib-services.md: PCNTL, POSIX, program execution, FFI, OPcache, session handling, filter, ctype, FTP, IMAP, mail, SOAP, OAuth, APCu, readline\n- composer.md: Composer, PIE, PECL, autoloading, version constraints, scripts, best practices\n- whats-new.md: PHP 8.5/8.4/8.3/8.2/8.1/8.0/7.x new features and migration guides\n- Updated skills_index.json with PHP skill metadata","tree":{"sha":"1fa09c87a00db1e652e03c04318bff0662e8177a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pledgeandgrow/pledge-skills/git/trees/1fa09c87a00db1e652e03c04318bff0662e8177a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pledgeandgrow/pledge-skills/git/commits/d100dc01126d3f78c46fc04d66e20aa8b7cbfe14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160181378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-berel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehdi-bere