"message":"feat: add enrollment form component with validation and telemetry preview\n\n- Created `enrollment-form` component with personal info and mission details sections.\n- Implemented form validation using Angular signals for required fields and conditional logic.\n- Added `success-card` component to display submission success message and data.\n- Introduced `telemetry-preview` component to show real-time form status and payload.\n- Developed `SpacePioneerService` for managing form state and submission logic.\n- Defined model interfaces for personal info, mission details, and companions.\n- Configured TypeScript paths for shared UI components.\n- Added PostCSS configuration for Tailwind CSS integration.\n- Created components configuration file for better structure.","tree":{"sha":"f247d62c57c7187ab00911ec2be11bc5c90ca88b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoan02/angular-22-mfe/git/trees/f247d62c57c7187ab00911ec2be11bc5c90ca88b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoan02/angular-22-mfe/git/commits/4613ccdec04a71f36ba8b4b0c4481cd84d46a199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84437274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoan02","id":84437274,"login":"hoan02","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDM3Mjc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoan02/subscript