81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:45:38Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:45:38Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"message":"fix: Populate impeccable reference files with real content from repo\n\n27 actual reference files downloaded from pbakaus/impeccable repo\n(384KB total). These are the command reference files: craft, critique,\naudit, polish, animate, bolder, quieter, distill, typeset, layout,\nlive, adapt, onboard, shape, extract, document, harden, optimize,\noverdrive, etc. — all with substantive content.\n\nRemoved 6 stub files that were placeholders at wrong paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenClaude (deepseek-v4-flash) <openclaude@gitlawb.com","tree":{"sha":"09de4e86379849b1e58429868c64e9ea2f667de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/trees/09de4e86379849b1e58429868c64e9ea2f667de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/commits/721c78eaf139628707326b1a1bd8101e45d89d81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/721c78eaf139628707326b1a1bd8101e45d89d81","node_id":"C_kwDOS0rV4doAKDcyMWM3OGVhZjEzOTYyODcwNzMyNmIxYTFiZDgxMDFlNDVkODlkODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237","sha":"f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237"}],"sha":"721c78eaf139628707326b1a1bd8101e45d89d81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/721c78eaf139628707326b1a1bd8101e45d89d81"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:42:00Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:42:00Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"message":"V3.0: Add UI/UX design system — Impeccable + taste-skill + Emil design engineering\n\n11 new UI/UX skills added to the ai-tech-org plugin:\n\n1. impeccable/ — 23 design commands + 7 domain references (typography, color,\n   spatial, motion, interaction, responsive, UX writing) from pbakaus/impeccable\n2. design-taste-frontend (v2) — anti-slop frontend with 3-dial system\n3. design-taste-frontend-v1 — original taste-skill preserved\n4. gpt-taste — stricter variant for GPT/Codex\n5. image-to-code — image-first pipeline frontend generation\n6. redesign-existing-projects — audit-first UI redesign\n7. high-end-visual-design — polished premium UI with soft contrast\n8. full-output-enforcement — no-placeholder-code enforcement\n9. minimalist-ui — editorial/Linear-style product UI\n10. industrial-brutalist-ui — Swiss type, sharp contrast, experimental\n11. stitch-design-taste — Google Stitch-compatible design rules\n\nPlus: Emil Kowalski design engineering (animation decision framework,\ninteraction design rules, UI review format) merged into ui-ux-designer skill.\n\nTotal skills: 239 -> 250. Agents unchanged at 118.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenClaude (deepseek-v4-flash) <openclaude@gitlawb.com","tree":{"sha":"acd618ab6859f7158f12da66bd36fc897feeaaf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/trees/acd618ab6859f7158f12da66bd36fc897feeaaf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/commits/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237","node_id":"C_kwDOS0rV4doAKGY0NmFlN2RjZGQxYjY3OGRkMjM5MDdlOTZlYTlkMmE2MTEwNDUyMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5","sha":"e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5"}],"sha":"f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/f46ae7dcdd1b678dd23907e96ea9d2a611045237"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:20:24Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:20:24Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"message":"V2.0: Add 118 agents from awesome-claude-code-toolkit\n\nMajor V2 update adding 118 specialized agents across 10 categories,\nmatching the structure from rohitg00/awesome-claude-code-toolkit:\n\n- Language Experts (25): Rust, Go, Python, TypeScript, React, Next.js, etc.\n- Core Development (12): API design, microservices, event-driven, mobile\n- Infrastructure (9): K8s, Terraform, SRE, platform engineering, networking\n- Quality Assurance (6): QA automation, penetration testing, accessibility\n- Data & AI (12): LLM architecture, MLOps, NLP, CV, vector databases\n- Developer Experience (15): Dev tooling, MCP, CLIs, DX optimization\n- Specialized Domains (15): Blockchain, fintech, healthcare, IoT, robotics\n- Business & Product (6): Business analysis, growth, legal, marketing\n- Orchestration (8): Multi-agent coord, workflow director, context mgmt\n- Research & Analysis (10): Competitive analysis, tech scouting, patents\n\nZero duplication with existing 239 skills. Each agent has YAML frontmatter\n(name, description, tools, model) + deep expertise instructions.\nREADME rewritten in clean table format matching toolkit style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenClaude (deepseek-v4-flash) <openclaude@gitlawb.com","tree":{"sha":"3e9333a62ce6f10ce8728ddb4a81e88915960648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/trees/3e9333a62ce6f10ce8728ddb4a81e88915960648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/commits/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5","node_id":"C_kwDOS0rV4doAKGU5ODI3YzVkNmQ0YzA4N2I4NWIxYWY5ZmUzNDliNWJmYTY3ZjFiZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5","sha":"68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5"}],"sha":"e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/e9827c5d6d4c087b85b1af9fe349b5bfa67f1be5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:03:59Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:03:59Z","email":"anandshrivastava@Anands-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Anand Shrivastava"},"message":"Initial commit: AI Tech Org — ScaleSync AI-Native Organization plugin\n\nComplete AI agency inside Claude Code: idea → market-fit → Docker-first build\n→ k8s/Helm → security/QA → release → launch → marketing → growth.\n239 skills, 6 commands, AOP governance hooks. Sub-agent driven, TDD-enforced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenClaude (deepseek-v4-flash) <openclaude@gitlawb.com","tree":{"sha":"1c35a576d8ab028a291c7e7bb20abfa2b6d3f771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/trees/1c35a576d8ab028a291c7e7bb20abfa2b6d3f771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/git/commits/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commit/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5","node_id":"C_kwDOS0rV4doAKDY4ZTM1ZGI2MGMyOGRkM2Q5M2E0NjU3ODA4MWFkNDYwYjdmOWNhYjU","parents":[],"sha":"68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits/68e35db60c28dd3d93a46578081ad460b7f9cab5"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anand195/ai-tech-org/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=721c78eaf139628707326b1a1bd8101e45d89d81&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A00%3A41.599Z"}');
