ithub.com/users/kildahldev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/commits/fe3312ad300dd501e8bac1e646e960b4e3bfad6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:20:50Z","email":"Mortenk98@gmail.com","name":"Morten"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:20:50Z","email":"Mortenk98@gmail.com","name":"Morten"},"message":"Fix API errors found in source-verification review; add version guard, verify workflow, app shell, modal starter\n\nFixes (verified against @kirbydesign/designsystem@11.8.0 types and upstream source):\n- attentionLevel is ''1''|''2''|''3'' — there is no level 4\n- item disclosure has no ''arrow'' value; item size has no ''lg''\n- kirby-data-table element does not exist; /data-table exports th[sortable]\n  (TableSortableComponent; DataTableModule is deprecated)\n- toast durationInMs defaults to 4000 ms — omitting it never makes a sticky toast\n- utils.border-radius(''m'') is not a valid key (radii: xxs xs s n l xl circle pill)\n- ''config'' is not a kirby-page input (it belongs to *kirbyPageActions)\n- themeColor unions are narrower per component (button, flag, card-header flagged)\n- overlay controllers are providedIn:''root'' — missing provideKirby does not\n  cause NullInjectorError; corrected troubleshooting accordingly\n- badge ''text'' input marked deprecated; boolean/number snippet bindings bracketed\n\nImprovements:\n- provenance stamp (v11.8.0, June 2026) + version guard: trust node_modules over\n  the skill on drift, check MIGRATION.md\n- \"Verify against the installed package\" section: grep the shipped .d.ts,\n  icon bundle, and SCSS token maps instead of guessing\n- app shell coverage: kirby-app + kirby-router-outlet (focusManager dependency),\n  kirby-tab-bar routing wiring with [tab] and selected-tab icons\n- new assets/detail-modal.component.ts: complete modal content starter\n  (COMPONENT_PROPS, Modal.close, canDismiss AlertConfig, kirby-modal-footer)\n- mental-model gotchas reformatted as wrong/right snippet pairs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5f27c1ddd75864f5ec79462b8bc4ff8434a7fe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/git/trees/e5f27c1ddd75864f5ec79462b8bc4ff8434a7fe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/git/commits/fe3312ad300dd501e8bac1e646e960b4e3bfad6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12143446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kildahldev","id":12143446,"login":"kildahldev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTQzNDQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kildahldev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/commit/fe3312ad300dd501e8bac1e646e960b4e3bfad6a","node_id":"C_kwDOS0zI-toAKGZlMzMxMmFkMzAwZGQ1MDFlOGJhYzFlNjQ2ZTk2MGI0ZTNiZmFkNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/commit/6643bf927c33a161b70d3bf4edcc74c782722999","sha":"6643bf927c33a161b70d3bf4edcc74c782722999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kildahldev/kirby-frontend-skill/commits/6643bf927c33a161b70d3bf4edcc74c782722999"}],"sha":"fe331