r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/7bce66191fb9d11ac97f75d272964b4188ac71b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T17:44:27Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T17:44:27Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Pulse: direct manager may read; writes freeze once reconciled\n\nThe manager review screen legitimately shows the report''s pulse (the\neditor toggle is literally ''Visible to your manager only'') but every\nopen logged a 403 — reads now allow owner OR direct manager. Writes\nstay owner-only and 409 (illegal_transition) on RECONCILED/\nCARRY_FORWARD, matching the item-edit freeze.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29f9f0c95f036c6face4314b6b9af8d7f97b66aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/29f9f0c95f036c6face4314b6b9af8d7f97b66aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/7bce66191fb9d11ac97f75d272964b4188ac71b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","orga