ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c93c998817dc4f17fd3ab7baa6264d4617482c22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T17:44:26Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T17:44:26Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Fix carry-forward finalize: reconcile first, then carry; surface errors\n\nThe confirm dialog fired carry-forward while still RECONCILING, which\nthe FSM rejects (legal only from RECONCILED/LOCKED), so any week with\nincomplete items could never be finalized — and the 409 was swallowed\nsilently. Reconcile now runs first; failures of either mutation render\na dismissible inline error note instead of an uncaught rejection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"408b88baaca96dffd4c4d15c0ce3e49d4a1b3515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/408b88baaca96dffd4c4d15c0ce3e49d4a1b3515"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/c93c998817dc4f17fd3ab7baa6264d4617482c22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url"