/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/19068c353ee0a83b9c534e14da1c34ed770f3b0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:48:42Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:48:42Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Reach planned-vs-actual from review queue; show real outcome names on items\n\n- The manager''s \"Planned vs actual\" (reconciliation diff) was unreachable:\n  ReviewDetailRoute never passed onReconcile, and ReviewDetail only renders\n  that control when onReconcile is set. Wire it to /reconcile/:id (read-only\n  for the manager).\n- Item cards showed a generic \"Linked outcome\" pill instead of the actual\n  Supporting Outcome. Resolve the title from the RCDO tree (new shared\n  lib/rcdo.outcomeTitleById) on My Week, manager Review Detail, and the\n  planned side of each Reconciliation row — so you can see which outcome each\n  commitment targets. Unlinked items keep their \"needs a Supporting Outcome\"\n  state.\n\nVerified live: priya → Manager → open Diego → \"Planned vs actual\" opens the\ndiff; item cards read \"Ingest PCAP for top 20 GPs\" etc. FE 269 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b648636eee617cb75d108c35d1fe053e483fe8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/4b648636eee617cb75d108c35d1fe053e483fe8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/19068c353ee0a83b9c534e14da1c34ed770f3b0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/19068c353ee0a83b9c534e14da1c34ed770f3b0d","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDE5MDY4YzM1M2VlMGE4M2I5YzUzNGUxNGRhMWMzNGVkNzcwZjNiMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055","sha":"008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055"}],"sha":"19068c353ee0a83b9c534e14da1c34ed770f3b0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/19068c353ee0a83b9c534e14da1c34ed770f3b0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:58:13Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:58:13Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Reconciliation: PENDING (not Incomplete) before marking; owner-only controls\n\nTwo bugs on the reconciliation screen:\n\n1. A LOCKED (or just-opened) week showed every item as red \"Incomplete · Will\n   carry forward\" before the IC decided anything — flagFor mapped OPEN/null →\n   INCOMPLETE, so the screen looked pre-reconciled. Now OPEN/null → a new\n   PENDING flag (neutral \"Pending\" pill, no carry-forward hint, excluded from\n   the incomplete/carrying-over counts); only an explicitly-marked INCOMPLETE\n   reads red.\n\n2. The owner-only controls (Begin reconciliation, the per-item status selects,\n   finalize, carry-forward) rendered for a non-owner — a manager can reach the\n   diff via ReviewDetail, where those writes 403. The view now carries\n   canReconcile (true only for the commit owner); the FE gates every write\n   control on it and shows a read-only \"Awaiting the owner''s reconciliation.\"\n   note to a manager.\n\nVerified live: sana (owner, LOCKED) sees Pending pills + Begin; priya (manager)\ngets canReconcile=false + read-only. Backend 137 tests, FE 265 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"611cb5c6cadf450d40b665c1db096d2e5d9b1c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/611cb5c6cadf450d40b665c1db096d2e5d9b1c98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDAwOGE0OWQ2ZDNlYmI1NjM3YjQ5MTc0NDJhNmE2MTkxMTg1YmQwNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862","sha":"12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862"}],"sha":"008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/008a49d6d3ebb5637b4917442a6a6191185bd055"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T08:37:57Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T08:37:57Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Wire the IC''s \"Begin reconciliation\" (LOCKED→RECONCILING) on the reconcile screen\n\nThe reconciliation screen was a read-only dead end for a LOCKED week: \"Start\nreconciliation\" on My Week only navigated here, and item statuses are editable\nonly while RECONCILING — but nothing performed the LOCKED→RECONCILING start, so\nthe IC could never mark completions (exactly the dead end reported). The\nbackend already allows the owner; the button was just never wired.\n\nAdd a LOCKED-state \"Begin reconciliation\" CTA (+ a hint) that POSTs\n/commits/{id}/reconcile (useStartReconcileMutation); on success the view\nrefetches as RECONCILING and the per-item Completed/Incomplete selects + the\n\"Carry forward & reconcile\" finalize action appear. Regression test covers\nLOCKED → CTA shown, no status select yet → click → POST start.\n\nVerified live: sana (IC) My Week → Start reconciliation → Begin reconciliation\n→ editable actuals → finalize. FE 264 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9321cf20a019b0db0a8c2d6b6339f8690e391559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/9321cf20a019b0db0a8c2d6b6339f8690e391559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDEyMDk0ZDc5NzJjYzc3ZWJmZTMyNzI0MzgxMTk2ZWJiMWFiMmQ4NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de","sha":"ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de"}],"sha":"12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/12094d7972cc77ebfe32724381196ebb1ab2d862"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:27:35Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:27:35Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Make reconciliation IC-driven; gate manager review on RECONCILED\n\nThe weekly lifecycle had the manager driving reconciliation and could mark a\ncommit REVIEWED before the IC ever reported completion — backwards from the\nassignment (commit → reconcile → manager review). Fixes:\n\n- Reconciliation is now OWNER-driven: the IC opens reconciliation\n  (LOCKED→RECONCILING), marks each item complete/incomplete (the actuals),\n  and finalizes (RECONCILING→RECONCILED). A manager attempting these now 403s.\n  LifecycleService.reconcile no longer touches the ManagerReview; the\n  /reconcile + /reconciled routes drop MANAGER_SCOPE (authenticated; the\n  service enforces owner-only).\n- Manager review is a separate step gated on RECONCILED: ReviewService rejects\n  a review until the IC has reconciled (409 on DRAFT/LOCKED/RECONCILING), and\n  a REVIEWED write now stamps the commit + fires review.completed.\n- RCDO edit-tree is admin-only for real: MemberAccountDto carries canEditRcdo\n  (= SCOPE_admin:rcdo from the security context); the FE gates \"Edit tree\" on\n  it, so managers (canReview) no longer see an editor whose Add buttons 403.\n- Persona pill gains a \"Reset demo data\" control (POST /api/e2e/reset) so a\n  drifted demo can return to the seed.\n- Review queue: only RECONCILED weeks are reviewable; a RECONCILED-unreviewed\n  row shows a \"Ready to review\" badge; LOCKED reads \"awaiting reconciliation\".\n- Seed kept consistent: RECONCILING Omar has no manager review (review only\n  after RECONCILED).\n\nVerified live: sana (IC) reconcile 200, priya reconcile-her-report 403, priya\nreview-before-reconcile 409, review-after-reconcile 200. Backend 137 tests,\nFE 263 tests, all gates green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e68905ece0f2b299c65dcdc574af4dc2b7652c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/6e68905ece0f2b299c65dcdc574af4dc2b7652c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKGNlMzgyMDhiYzhiY2ZlMDlkY2I1NjQ2N2UzZDZjZmUyMGQ3NjUxZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/69a2503bfed425b4d189d49744d0728beb43ac47","sha":"69a2503bfed425b4d189d49744d0728beb43ac47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/69a2503bfed425b4d189d49744d0728beb43ac47"}],"sha":"ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/ce38208bc8bcfe09dcb56467e3d6cfe20d7651de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/69a2503bfed425b4d189d49744d0728beb43ac47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T04:35:34Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T04:35:34Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Fix review-queue \"0/N done\" mislabel + graceful Outlook-unconfigured state\n\nTwo issues surfaced on the live demo:\n\n1. Manager Review Queue showed \"0/2 done\" for reports whose week is Submitted\n   (LOCKED) or Draft — but item completion only exists after RECONCILIATION,\n   so a planned-but-not-reconciled week is 0-done by definition and the label\n   read as failure. Now show the PLANNED item count (\"2 items\") for non-\n   reconciled weeks and reserve \"X/Y done\" for RECONCILED/RECONCILING.\n\n2. \"Connect Outlook\" on a host with no Entra/Graph config (the demo deploy,\n   no AZURE_* env) built an authorize URL with an empty client_id that\n   dead-ended on a Microsoft error. The connect endpoint now 409s when\n   unconfigured, OutlookConnectionDto carries an `available` flag, and the\n   Settings → Integrations card shows \"Outlook isn''t enabled on this host.\"\n   instead of a Connect button. (Real Outlook on the public host still needs\n   HTTPS + the public redirect registered in Azure — the domain/cert path.)\n\nVerified on the live deploy (screenshots): queue shows 2/3 done / 2 items /\n2 items; Integrations shows the unavailable note, no Connect button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"443ffca1b1710d8fd848d475bf0768eb84a68a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/443ffca1b1710d8fd848d475bf0768eb84a68a11"},