_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c176c74ae538dff19073fa30074abc4d8210a9d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Add demo login bypass + persona switcher pill (changeboard CB-2)\n\nProductizes the hermetic e2e identity seam into demo-only UI, double-gated\non isE2e() so the real Auth0 path never renders it (KTD13):\n\n- Login bypass: the standalone sign-in screen gains a \"Demo personas\"\n  section (Sofia/Priya/Diego/Sana/Tom quick-login buttons) that persists\n  the hermetic identity and reloads.\n- PersonaPill: a floating bottom-right switcher showing the acting persona;\n  selecting another persists identity + hard-reloads with the full\n  ?member=&manager=&name= seam params (fresh auth + RTK cache).\n- Hermetic SIGNED-OUT flag (review-blocker fix): the e2e branch previously\n  auto-authenticated unconditionally, making the login screen - and the\n  bypass - unreachable. AuthBridge now reports unauthenticated while\n  wcm.e2e.signedOut is set; the pill''s Sign out + Settings'' Sign out set it,\n  and every sign-in path (bypass click, ?member= URL, login()) clears it,\n  so the full demo loop (sign out -> bypass -> switch) is demonstrable.\n\nTests cover gating off the real path, switching, sign-out, and the\nsigned-out -> login + bypass -> sign-in wiring regression.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f8635473a4f36a7fdea55cfc806f7263aad9838","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/2f8635473a4f36a7fdea55cfc806f7263aad9838"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/c176c74ae538dff19073fa30074abc4d8210a9d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/c176c74ae538dff19073fa30074abc4d8210a9d1","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKGMxNzZjNzRhZTUzOGRmZjE5MDczZmEzMDA3NGFiYzRkODIxMGE5ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987","sha":"397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987"}],"sha":"c176c74ae538dff19073fa30074abc4d8210a9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c176c74ae538dff19073fa30074abc4d8210a9d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Add \"Schedule 1:1\" dialog to the manager review screen (CB-1, frontend)\n\nReviewDetail gains a Schedule 1:1 action that opens a design-system modal\n(prefilled subject, date/time defaulting to tomorrow 10:00, duration\nselect, optional note) and books the event via the new scheduleOutlookEvent\nRTK Query mutation. A 409 illegal_state (manager''s Outlook not connected)\nrenders an inline \"Connect Outlook in Settings -> Integrations\" error;\nsuccess shows a brief Scheduled state. MSW handlers + contract types added;\n13 new Vitest cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c55d450aaccaa7950d7a517e89ea00fce2da60b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/1c55d450aaccaa7950d7a517e89ea00fce2da60b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDM5N2M1YzUwOWMyMDU3YjQ3Njk4N2ViZjZkNjZhYzBhMjM3NzM5ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c","sha":"1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c"}],"sha":"397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/397c5c509c2057b476987ebf6d66ac0a23773987"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:58:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Add manager scheduling endpoint (changeboard CB-1, backend)\n\nPOST /api/integration/outlook/schedule lets a manager schedule an event\n(e.g. a 1:1) for one of their OWN reports from the manager surface:\n\n- Route-gated behind the manager scope in BOTH security chains; row-level\n  guard requires acting.id == report.managerId (Objects.equals — null-safe\n  for top-level members); unknown report 404; Outlook-not-connected 409\n  illegal_state; bean validation (duration 15..240, subject<=200) 400.\n- CalendarSyncPort gains scheduleEvent(ScheduledEventCommand): the Graph\n  adapter books it with the ORGANIZER''s delegated token (POST /me/events,\n  UTC-converted window, report as required attendee, note + deep link in\n  the HTML body); the stub records commands for tests. Blank subject\n  defaults to \"1:1 — <report name>\"; ad-hoc scheduling is deliberately not\n  idempotency-keyed (unlike the lock sync).\n\nVerified live against real Graph (priya -> diego 200 + event id; employee\n403; cross-manager 403). 9 new tests (OutlookScheduleIT matrix + adapter\npayload tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac824a7b132de8279c58a7fb160b5d2f5a9b148d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/ac824a7b132de8279c58a7fb160b5d2f5a9b148d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDFhNGE2NDdiMWNiN2QxYTgxZjgwZGNlYTVhZjE0OTlhYjUyN2NhNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137","sha":"493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137"}],"sha":"1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/1a4a647b1cb7d1a81f80dcea5af1499ab527ca6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:45:16Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:45:16Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Honor the createEventOnLock toggle; persist Graph event id + lastSyncAt\n\nLive Outlook verification (real Graph tenant) surfaced two gaps in the\ncommit.locked calendar consumer:\n\n- The Settings toggle \"create a calendar event when I lock my week\"\n  (OutlookPreference.createEventOnLock) gated NOTHING — the sync ran\n  regardless. The consumer now checks it via OutlookService\n  .createEventOnLockEnabled (default true when no row, so the toggle only\n  opts out); a deliberate opt-out skips the port but still counts the event\n  handled (no SQS redelivery).\n- The Graph event id returned by CalendarSyncPort was logged then dropped:\n  commit_item.outlook_event_id stayed null (dead column, contract says\n  \"stored on the commit\") and OutlookPreference.lastSyncAt never updated, so\n  the Settings \"last synced\" indicator could never show. On success the\n  consumer now persists both via OutlookService.recordLockSync (one writable\n  transaction, lazily creating the preference row).\n\nRegression tests in CommitLockedConsumerIT (persistence + opt-out skip,\nred->green), EventDispatchFailureTest updated for the new seam, and\nSnsSqsEventingIT cleanup now removes the lazily-created preference row\nbefore deleting its member (FK).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5808cd30445f23c10dae9d099a07505878538a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/5808cd30445f23c10dae9d099a07505878538a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDQ5MzMyMGEwZTgwNTUyZTRmZGJhODJmMmRmMWViYmViMDM1YzIxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5","sha":"c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5"}],"sha":"493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/493320a0e80552e4fdba82f2df1ebbeb035c2137"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:58:16Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:58:16Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Correct MS Graph setup: create a free Entra tenant (directory-less reg deprecated)\n\nMicrosoft deprecated registering apps outside a directory, so a bare personal\naccount can''t register an app. Updated Path 1 to: create a free Entra ID tenant\n(separate from an Azure subscription / M365 dev program), register a multi-tenant\napp, AZURE_TENANT_ID=common, and consent with a personal account (whose\noutlook.com calendar is the sync target, since a new tenant has no mailboxes).\nPlus fallbacks (work/school directory, or defer the live demo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9ca9221f98b49f88e4f950b84a436a91f55937e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/d9ca9221f98b49f88e4f950b84a436a91f55937e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKGMwMjVkOGQzY2Q4OTJmNmE5MzNlMmQyZjg1MjQ1NmE5ZGUzODE0YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/f06be9db047b364709c4bbf140c870343401f401","sha":"f06be9db047b364709c4bbf140c870343401f401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/f06be9db047b364709c4bbf140c870343401f401"}],"sha":"c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/c025d8d3cd892f6a933e2d2f852456a9de3814c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/f06be9db047b364709c4bbf140c870343401f401/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:38:18Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:38:18Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Map demo role-anchors to real Auth0 subjects; fix seed-vs-login race\n\nFor a live Auth0 login demo, three seeded role-anchor members can adopt real\nAuth0 user subjects via env vars (DEMO_ADMIN/MANAGER/EMPLOYEE_AUTH0_SUB ->\nsofia/priya/diego), so a real browser login lands on the already-rich seeded\nmember (manager graph + commits + reconciliations) instead of a blank JIT\nmember. Unset env (tests/e2e/normal boot) keeps the hermetic auth0|seed-<slug>\nsubjects, so behavior there is unchanged.\n\nAlso fixes a seed-vs-request race: Tomcat accepts traffic before the\nCommandLineRunner finishes, so a login/probe could JIT-provision one of these\nsubjects (a blank stub with a random id) before the seeder inserts the\ndeterministic member — the seeder then hit uq_member_auth0_subject and the app\nfailed to start. The seeder now adopts the subject by deleting a pre-existing\nnon-seed stub first, so the seed identity (referenced by seeded commits/reviews)\nwins. Verified live: employee/manager/admin user tokens land on Diego/Priya/Sofia\nwith the right data and role-gating (403s for the employee).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a98db7b1295d9751659d54726d552ef800ca31c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/4a98db7b1295d9751659d54726d552ef800ca31c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/f06be9db047b364709c4bbf140c870343401f401","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h