ttps://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/3dbdc396248563eb791752ddcb09f63ca09be594/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:35:06Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:35:06Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Document a no-Azure-subscription MS Graph path (personal account + Entra)\n\nApp registrations live in free Entra ID, not an Azure subscription. Add a\npersonal-Microsoft-account path (entra.microsoft.com, multi-tenant + personal\naccounts, AZURE_TENANT_ID=consumers) for when the M365 dev program / Azure\nsubscription signup is unavailable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6753281b6257aabaae0d39f04fcbd334ec05892f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/6753281b6257aabaae0d39f04fcbd334ec05892f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/3dbdc396248563eb791752ddcb09f63ca09be594","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/3dbdc396248563eb791752ddcb09f63ca09be594","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDNkYmRjMzk2MjQ4NTYzZWI3OTE3NTJkZGNiMDlmNjNjYTA5YmU1OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144","sha":"d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144"}],"sha":"3dbdc396248563eb791752ddcb09f63ca09be594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/3dbdc396248563eb791752ddcb09f63ca09be594"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:18:11Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T18:18:11Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Fix first-login provisioning failing inside a read-only transaction\n\nA brand-new Auth0 user whose first request hit a read-only endpoint got a 500:\nJwtCurrentMemberProvider lazily JIT-provisions the Member, but the INSERT ran\ninside the caller''s @Transactional(readOnly=true) service method (e.g.\nRollupQueryService.rollup, CommitService.currentWeek) — Postgres rejects\n\"INSERT in a read-only transaction.\" Hermetic tests never hit this because they\npre-seed members; a real Auth0 login (new subject) would 500 on its first read.\n\nSurfaced while verifying the live Auth0 wiring with a real minted token\n(GET /api/rollup -> 500).\n\nFix: move the INSERT into a dedicated MemberProvisioningWriter bean annotated\n@Transactional(REQUIRES_NEW), so provisioning commits in its own writable tx\nregardless of the caller''s. The hot path (member already exists) stays a plain\nread that joins the caller''s tx. Also synthesize email/displayName from the\nsubject when a token omits those claims (NOT-NULL columns). Regression:\nJitProvisioningWebIT (fresh subject -> read-only GET -> 204 + provisioned;\nno-email token still provisions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d7386707e6901ea2671448ac68b1cf45269faca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/6d7386707e6901ea2671448ac68b1cf45269faca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKGQxMTM4YThkN2E1YTg4ZDU1ZGY1MDk5MjkxNGEzMzQxNmNkY2MxNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e","sha":"2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e"}],"sha":"d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/d1138a8d7a5a88d55df50992914a33416cdcc144"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:32:03Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:32:03Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Document admin:rcdo Auth0 permission + admin role for the RCDO edit-tree\n\nThe re-skin added the admin RCDO edit-tree (gated by SCOPE_admin:rcdo); the\nexternal-services setup guide now tells the operator to create the admin:rcdo\npermission + an admin role, and lists the host-shell :4200 callback origin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1699bdd77991dd6d92eb7b4193255af694c49243","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/1699bdd77991dd6d92eb7b4193255af694c49243"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDI1NjJhZTBhNjY2YTJlNTllNmU5MWJkYjc3Njk1YzAyMDg5ZWY0NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2","sha":"47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2"}],"sha":"2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/2562ae0a666a2e59e6e91bdb77695c02089ef44e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:27:22Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:27:22Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Fix live E2E flows after the re-skin (RCDO picker, reconcile, steps)\n\nThe federated E2E surfaced reskin gaps the unit tests couldn''t:\n- EditCommit now passes a \"Suggested for you\" shortlist to the RcdoPickerDrawer\n  so a Supporting Outcome (level-4 leaf) is reachable at the picker root — the\n  lifecycle link step now resolves it.\n- Reconciliation shows the lifecycle badge in its reconciled success banner\n  (design''s \"badge everywhere\" rule) and offers a post-RECONCILED \"Carry\n  forward\" action (FSM keeps carry-forward separate from the manager''s\n  reconcile) — unblocking the owner''s carry-forward flow.\n- Cypress steps updated for the new design: chess tier is a segmented\n  radiogroup (click data-tier, not cy.select), and the Team Dashboard column\n  header reads \"Alignment\" (assert within the roll-up table).\n\nAll 6 Cypress specs + the Playwright smoke pass against the live federated\nstack; tsc clean; 240 Vitest tests; coverage 95.6/91.7/81.9/95.6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55aeaeaaa1a871560dec3ba096347f9f0a8eb61b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/55aeaeaaa1a871560dec3ba096347f9f0a8eb61b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2","node_id":"C_kwDOS02XtdoAKDQ3ZDk3YzBmNDRlMzgwMDI2MDQzODQzZmQ4NDBhMGI0NzhlZWRmZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commit/6db1081288e04c304e58b1b296056188bec31fe6","sha":"6db1081288e04c304e58b1b296056188bec31fe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/6db1081288e04c304e58b1b296056188bec31fe6"}],"sha":"47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/47d97c0f44e380026043843fd840a0b478eedff2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/6db1081288e04c304e58b1b296056188bec31fe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:03:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T17:03:32Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Fix global.css comment prematurely closing the CSS block\n\nThe design-system stylesheet''s header comment contained \".btn-*/.input\",\nand the \"*/\" inside it terminated the CSS block comment early — so the\nproduction vite build''s PostCSS parser choked (\"Unknown word .input\") and\nthe wc-remote MF build failed. (Vitest/jsdom didn''t exercise this path.)\nReworded the comment to remove the stray \"*/\". Production build now emits\nremoteEntry.js + WeeklyCommitApp + widget cleanly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08cfdf531cbe87adfb36d66d87828d2dca19aa1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/08cfdf531cbe87adfb36d66d87828d2dca19aa1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/6db1081288e04c304e58b1b296056188bec31fe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login"