l":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/commits/2fb9a9c16bf19139b814d7d83a2c48822696e9b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:59:13Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:59:13Z","email":"bryannalarcon@gmail.com","name":"bryannalarcon"},"message":"Add WCM backend API + Auth0 security + event seam\n\nREST API: commit CRUD + submit (DRAFT->LOCKED), RCDO browse, reconciliation\n(plan-vs-actual + transitions), manager review + Pageable roll-up; RFC-7807\nerrors; springdoc OpenAPI; the API contract emitted to libs/types + MSW\nhandlers to libs/api for frontend parallelism. In-process EventPublisher seam\n(commit.locked / review.completed).\n\nAuth0 resource server (issuer/audience/JWKS, SCOPE_ authorities) with row-level\nauthorization: acting member always from the JWT (never the body); ownership\nchecks on /commits/{id}; manager drives reconcile transitions and sees only own\nreports. Review caught + harden fixed 5 blocking/high issues incl. a\nmanager-review bypass; test-JWT @Profile(\"test\").\n\nmvn verify green: 32 unit + 42 integration tests, 94.7% line coverage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"475e11a4a5bab11f13b52bf706c219e52568050a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/475e11a4a5bab11f13b52bf706c219e52568050a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/2fb9a9c16bf19