vacuous by\nadding real covered logic, since JaCoCo skips Lombok @Generated code). A\nTestcontainers integration test proves audit fields auto-populate.\n\nFrontend (Nx + npm workspaces, Vite 5 MF, React 18): wc-remote exposes\n./WeeklyCommitApp via @module-federation/vite (remoteEntry.js builds), host-shell\nconsumes it; TS strict + noUncheckedIndexedAccess, ESLint 9, Prettier 3.3,\nVitest + RTL green, Tailwind + Flowbite.\n\nPackage manager: npm workspaces (PRD line 77 explicitly waives replicating\nYarn Workspaces + Nx; Yarn classic hit an Nx @nrwl/tao resolution bug).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed961da883e0ec066f8d706b16624df37a102ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/ed961da883e0ec066f8d706b16624df37a102ce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryannalarcon-hash/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/3370afe16c7c715df991ad4ee3ea410d8045c92e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228078676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryannalarcon-hash","id":228078676,"login":"bryannalarcon-hash","node_id":"U_kgDODZg0VA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryannalarcon-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use