vyWidget/mathPack/workers) as separate observable chunks\n- Root scripts: bun run dev now starts the hub (dev:hub alias; dev:lN unchanged)\n\nVerified: workspace typecheck clean (engine + 6 apps), all builds green,\nhub dev server boots.","tree":{"sha":"41ecafb72c17c5141d9b09455168845360708cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/trees/41ecafb72c17c5141d9b09455168845360708cd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/commits/ab37c8926d4855597d6222cd0ce4ed690751b1ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 41ecafb72c17c5141d9b09455168845360708cd5\nparent 6204e6dd4122401e77bb8d9c9e5915d02340e460\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781055010 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781055010 +0000\n\nAdd workbook-hub: navigate all levels in one app\n\n- Engine (@sfe/workbook) now supports two modes:\n  * single level (existing per-level apps, URLs unchanged)\n  * hub mode: <WorkbookApp levels={...}> with routes /, /:levelId, /:levelId/:slug\n- New engine components: HubShell (level-switcher sidebar with collapsible\n  per-level concept groups + coming-soon roadmap), HubOverview (landing cards),\n  LevelScope (resolves :levelId and provides context to the shared\n  Overview/ConceptPage via a base link prefix)\n- New app apps/workbook-hub aggregating all 5 LEVEL registries from the sibling\n  apps; Tailwind @source covers every level''s sources\n- Build: one chunk per level + vendor chunks, keeping Level 1''s dynamic-import\n  demo modules (HeavyWidget/mathPack/workers) as separate observable chunks\n- Root scripts: bun run dev now starts the hub (dev:hub alias; dev:lN unchanged)\n\nVerified: workspace typecheck clean (engine + 6 apps), all builds green,\nhub dev server boots.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOt66klE\nQeI