NWQwMjM0MGU0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commit/0b9b03fc1371a65084668f8eab0400feab6587e4","sha":"0b9b03fc1371a65084668f8eab0400feab6587e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commits/0b9b03fc1371a65084668f8eab0400feab6587e4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commit/b3e7bd133c9e78d8ec3f20767e39a719f35cb66e","sha":"b3e7bd133c9e78d8ec3f20767e39a719f35cb66e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commits/b3e7bd133c9e78d8ec3f20767e39a719f35cb66e"}],"sha":"6204e6dd4122401e77bb8d9c9e5915d02340e460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commits/6204e6dd4122401e77bb8d9c9e5915d02340e460"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commits/b3e7bd133c9e78d8ec3f20767e39a719f35cb66e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:15:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:15:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Level 5 — Caching & Networking strategies (10 concepts)\n\nNew workspace app apps/level-5-caching-networking on the shared @sfe/workbook\nengine, with deep theory + interactive simulations + fix-it exercises:\n\n- Cache invalidation (TTL vs keyed vs clear-all against a versioned server)\n- Stale-while-revalidate (blocking spinner vs instant-stale + background update)\n- ETag vs Cache-Control (fresh / 304 / full-200 regimes + transferred-bytes meter)\n- HTTP/3 & QUIC (animated TCP HoL blocking vs independent QUIC streams)\n- Backpressure in Streams (fast producer vs slow consumer, HWM respected or not)\n- AbortController (cancelable task, AbortSignal.any + timeout, error taxonomy)\n- Streaming fetch (real ReadableStream: buffered vs token streaming + abort)\n- Priority hints (default vs fetchpriority schedules; LCP completion time)\n- SameSite cookie modes (live Strict/Lax/None decision table + PSL edge cases)\n- Speculative prerendering (hover-to-speculate; none/prefetch/prerender timing)\n\nRoot scripts (dev:l5) + READMEs updated.\nVerified: workspace typecheck clean, all apps build, dev server boots.","tree":{"sha":"a9a1c7ed5f44b343f575746734e831b3ce4d691b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/trees/a9a1c7ed5f44b343f575746734e831b3ce4d691b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/commits/b3e7bd133c9e78d8ec3f20767e39a719f35cb66e","verification":{"payload":"tree a9a1c7ed5f44b343f575746734e831b3ce4d691b\nparent 0b9b03fc1371a65084668f8eab0400feab6587e4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781054154 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781054154 +0000\n\nAdd Level 5 — Caching & Networking strategies (10 concepts)\n\nNew workspace app apps/level-5-caching-networking on the shared @sfe/workbook\nengine, with deep theory + interactive simulations + fix-it exercises:\n\n- Cache invalidation (TTL vs keyed vs clear-all against a versioned server)\n-