hub.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/commits/17b09ac8aed3fc6275d63653fd63a5c52c44d18c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T00:19:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T00:19:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Level 4 — Advanced Data & State management (10 concepts)\n\nNew workspace app apps/level-4-data-state on the shared @sfe/workbook engine,\nwith deep theory + interactive demos + fix-it exercises:\n\n- Structural sharing (per-node reference identity: path-copy vs deep clone)\n- Immutable data patterns (mutation -> stale UI; immutable -> updates)\n- Referential equality (inline props defeat React.memo; stable refs fix it)\n- Memoization pitfalls (unstable deps make useMemo always miss)\n- Race conditions (out-of-order responses; sequence-token guard)\n- Finite state modeling (FSM vs reachable impossible boolean states)\n- Event sourcing (fold an event log; time-travel slider + undo/redo)\n- Optimistic UI rollback (instant update; forced-failure rollback; reconcile)\n- Deterministic rendering (random vs stable-id sort tiebreaker)\n- Idempotent UI actions (double-charge vs idempotency-key dedupe)\n\nRoot scripts (dev:l4) + READMEs updated.\nVerified: workspace typecheck clean, all apps build, dev server boots.","tree":{"sha":"146d8298889320ff254d978121e974a9c614ebd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/trees/146d8298889320ff254d978121e974a9c614ebd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vietanhrs/senior-front-end-topics/git/commits/17b09ac8aed3fc6275d63653fd63a5c52c44d18c","verification":{"payload":"tree 146d8298889320ff254d978121e974a9c614ebd7\nparent c0a93f6e4b026ef39b815d50ff66829764f879b1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781050753 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781050753 +0000\n\nAdd Level 4 — Advanced Data & State management (10 concepts)\n\nNew workspace app apps/level-4-data-state on the shared @sfe/workbook engine,\nwith deep theory + interactive demos + fix-it exercises:\n\n- Structural sharing (per-node reference identity: path-copy vs deep clone)\n- Immutable data patterns (mutation -> stale UI; immutable -> updates)\n- Referential equality (inline props defeat React.memo; stable refs fix it)\n- Memoization pitfalls (unstable deps make useMemo always miss)\n- Race conditions (out-of-order responses; sequence-token guard)\n- Finite state modeling (FSM vs reachable impossible boolean states)\n- Event sourcing (fold an event log; time-travel slider + undo/redo)\n- Optimistic UI rollback (instant update; forced-failure rollback; reconcile)\n- Deterministic rendering (random vs stable-id sort tiebreaker)\n- Idempotent UI actions (double-charge vs idempotency-key dedupe)\n\nRoot scripts (dev:l4) + READMEs updated.\nVerified: workspace typecheck clean, all apps build, dev server boots.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFP/ZU7w\nFSUMalOdcz8M0DWuB9iTrFpQXebIyFdyNjS9yqKGtU6AzWFFjaIdjB8oNTcUCBei1vRWeBZfcFlJ\nWAs=\n-----EN